  "steps": [
    "To a bowl add 1 tbsp red chilli powder, ½ tsp turmeric powder, 1 tbsp coriander powder, ½ tsp salt, 75ml water.",
    "Mix everything really well to make a nice smooth paste and set it aside.",
    "Now using a mortar and pestle or grinder, crush 10 garlic cloves, 1 tsp cumin seeds.",
    "To a pan on medium heat, add 4 tbsp oil.",
    "Once the oil is hot, add the crushed garlic and cumin seeds and fry for around 30 seconds.",
    "Now lower the heat and pour in the chilli mixture along with 1.5 tbsp yogurt.",
    "Add ½ handful fresh coriander and mix everything really well.",
    "Cook for 2 minutes and your Rajasthani Lahsun Chutney is ready!"
